cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these outputs, please cite this repository and the dataset."
title: "Fine-Tuned Open-Weight LLM for Rubric-Based Short-Answer Grading"
abstract: >-
  Code, saved model outputs and analysis scripts for rubric-based grading of short answers
  in business education with Gemma 2 9B-IT fine-tuned with LoRA. Answers are classified as
  On-Topic, Off-Topic or No Answer and scored on four criteria (Clarity, Terminology,
  Coverage, Accuracy); results are compared with examiner grades, commercial models
  (zero-shot and few-shot) and a DeBERTa-v3 encoder baseline.
